# Workshop-specific documentation dependencies.
#
# Dependencies already provided by the Sphinx Stack
# (canonical/sphinx-stack/docs/requirements.txt) must NOT be listed here.
# Only add Workshop-specific dependencies.
#
# Keep constraints loose, matching the Sphinx Stack convention. Pinning a full
# transitive closure here puts every sub-dependency into the repository
# dependency graph and generates Dependabot and Trivy findings for packages
# that Workshop neither ships nor controls.

